 by Zenichi’s actions in the most exaggerated manner."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10464"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/5078b5af7fd9ddc81eae38d2e1d7c56167e53cd08e1a26c5a190b4aeee9445b0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd87e17ec4178dae783050244b56273b4951965302d41904fa88cb4057dfdf34.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"咲乃 藍里","creatorId":"vndb:s436","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s436","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s436","name":"咲乃 藍里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:46768","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10466","characterName":"アイノ＝テア＝クーヴルール","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10466"},"originalCharacterName":"アイノ＝テア＝クーヴルール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"120"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"72"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"144"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"75"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"47"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Aino is a transfer student from Finland. Energetic and always curious, this stereotypical character fits in the role of a “genkiko” (Energetic girl). Always looking for something new, everything in Japan seems to amazes this girl who spent most of her life in Europe. It also seems as if Zenichi’s dad was Aino’s original teacher, and the initiation for her to transfer over in the first place. Because of this, Aino finds Zenichi comfortable, and agrees to assist him with the “Lovely Smile” activities."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10466"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/931d3d48d4c561ae1c08b414f9cc3b1ed878501695848f2d11504d1596e79f40.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc2e14939b4baf0e1370c3b0241fd1cfd8574de9b731e65223175562b540bef9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深田 愛衣","creatorId":"vndb:s607","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s607","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s607","name":"深田 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:46772","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10467","characterName":"八乙女 いろは","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10467"},"originalCharacterName":"八乙女 いろは","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"502"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Iroha is another tsundere/sadistic character. She loves to enjoy seeing others suffer mentally, and Zenichi is not an exception. Despite this, she has a “cute side” that she tries to hide from everyone else… but it appears so easily in front of the protagonist, easily mesmerizing him to this girl who always acts cold."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has an obsession for shiratama dango."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10467"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4ae874d0ed860b0abcd8b3eddd819d1013e2e84a3258c782de82f19e8e6df899.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a65e40e004c1e7014d1581d24b27c3b0591e6008c61c7eefdeeb0aef5127981d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水 愛","creatorId":"vndb:s416","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s416","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s416","name":"清水 愛","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:46767","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c10468","characterName":"仁科 綾花","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c10468"},"originalCharacterName":"仁科 綾花","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1117"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"91"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Vice President of the Student Council. She originally agrees to the Lovely Smile activities, and even agrees to assist Zenichi with the differentiation between “pure” and “impure”. A typical upperclassman adored by many of the students including Zenichi himself. Ayaka is also detached from the rest of the members; many of the scenes only involve the four heroines mentioned previously."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10468"}],"profileFacts":[],"metada